{"4084730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ass Kicker", "steam_appid": 4084730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The World is on the edge of Chaos...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>             Keep edging, it's been worse...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/d15147a231b30da779873b0da9efa989.avif?t=1765428762\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Ass Kicker</i></strong> is a Pixel Art adventure with gameplay inspired by great classics like <strong>Megaman</strong> <strong>X</strong>, featuring a story based on a <i>D&amp;D</i> campaign that, honestly, only the people who played it still remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(<strong><i>AK</i></strong>: Good times… strawberry milk was cheaper back then.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of <strong><i>AK</i></strong>, a wisecracking bard who constantly breaks the fourth wall (<strong><i>AK</i></strong>: It was already broken when I got here!). Explore the land of <strong><i>Askverg</i></strong>, and look for the perfect heroes for a perfect tale!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>(<strong>AK</strong>: Perfect might be overselling... how about adequate?)</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/99e5f8cf7a9cb163ee63446ff6580025.avif?t=1765428762\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>What awaits you:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/9120ee8e4d59fe9cf5b3eefcb9196d74.avif?t=1765428762\" width=600 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/d400a6b23e813bfb2c9015343ec2d5ca.poster.avif?t=1765428762\" width=512 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/d400a6b23e813bfb2c9015343ec2d5ca.webm?t=1765428762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/d400a6b23e813bfb2c9015343ec2d5ca.mp4?t=1765428762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapting a first <i>D&amp;D</i> adventure of an inexperienced Dungeon Master, <strong><i>Ass Kicker</i></strong> is a first game of an equally inexperienced deV! (<strong><i>AK</i></strong>: He is obviously talking about himself...)<br>Experience a story created from Friendship, tabletop madness, the dumbest of jokes...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And above all...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PURE OBESSESION FOR A DREAM. (<strong><i>AK</i></strong>: Yep... the deV is kind of nuts)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/5f58813302104f89311bc59e1c701d14.avif?t=1765428762\" width=600 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/95e032a1447e54226075eb03ffa9a74e.avif?t=1765428762\" width=256 height=128 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/683ba4beb9ba243119e9893019641560.avif?t=1765428762\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the heroes of tomorrow, inspired by the real player characters from that old campaign, where the , now, protagonist AK (<strong><i>AK</i></strong>: That's me!!) tries to gather a party epic enough to become legends... and maybe their ballad makes gold &amp; fame enough to pay his tab on his favorite tavern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">(<strong><i>AK:</i></strong> If the bard with the flower name can hit the jackpot, I sure can!!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/1ec3186a270feea906ee320e6eb62604.avif?t=1765428762\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/d2f3f5a7fc30e76f1dfc75aabd98caee.poster.avif?t=1765428762\" width=512 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/d2f3f5a7fc30e76f1dfc75aabd98caee.webm?t=1765428762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/d2f3f5a7fc30e76f1dfc75aabd98caee.mp4?t=1765428762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in the land of <strong><i>Askverg</i></strong>, it is common for adventurers to use sword &amp; sorcery in their travels, with <strong><i>AK</i></strong> is no different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bard is a wielder of <i>runic magic</i>, a rare and ancient art that demands the understanding of the forgotten texts.(<strong><i>AK</i></strong>: That <i>Wizard</i> course finally paid off!) <br>With a gameplay inspired by <strong>Megaman X</strong>, unleash the <i>runic magic</i> and mock your enemies  or thunder wave them into oblivion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful! Even ancient powers runs out if you get cocky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/a8a38a8d4ef80f2f31e73382842d3a13.avif?t=1765428762\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/ad9a489bd8a5955b8ff1bb8f9ae6b0b9.poster.avif?t=1765428762\" width=512 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/ad9a489bd8a5955b8ff1bb8f9ae6b0b9.webm?t=1765428762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/ad9a489bd8a5955b8ff1bb8f9ae6b0b9.mp4?t=1765428762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite being <strong><i><u>constantly</u></i></strong> under threat, <strong>Askverg</strong> remains a land full of beauty, and most of this beauty is brought to life through experimental Pixel Art! (AK: Experimental because the dev can’t draw properly!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/9e41f13f7e1e1e5a68c2fcc12007590c.avif?t=1765428762\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/99e5f8cf7a9cb163ee63446ff6580025.avif?t=1765428762\" width=64 height=64 /></span><i>(<strong>AK</strong>: Seriously, if you add us to your wishlist, I'll drink a Strawberry milk in your honor!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what are you waiting for?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your hat, tune your instrument, and join the song.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Legends don’t write themselves — and every good story needs a solid kick to get started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">(<strong><i>AK</i></strong>: Man... I can't believe he menaged to explain the title)</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The World is on the edge of Chaos...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>             Keep edging, it's been worse...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/d15147a231b30da779873b0da9efa989.avif?t=1765428762\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Ass Kicker</i></strong> is a Pixel Art adventure with gameplay inspired by great classics like <strong>Megaman</strong> <strong>X</strong>, featuring a story based on a <i>D&amp;D</i> campaign that, honestly, only the people who played it still remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(<strong><i>AK</i></strong>: Good times… strawberry milk was cheaper back then.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of <strong><i>AK</i></strong>, a wisecracking bard who constantly breaks the fourth wall (<strong><i>AK</i></strong>: It was already broken when I got here!). Explore the land of <strong><i>Askverg</i></strong>, and look for the perfect heroes for a perfect tale!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>(<strong>AK</strong>: Perfect might be overselling... how about adequate?)</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/99e5f8cf7a9cb163ee63446ff6580025.avif?t=1765428762\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>What awaits you:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/9120ee8e4d59fe9cf5b3eefcb9196d74.avif?t=1765428762\" width=600 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/d400a6b23e813bfb2c9015343ec2d5ca.poster.avif?t=1765428762\" width=512 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/d400a6b23e813bfb2c9015343ec2d5ca.webm?t=1765428762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/d400a6b23e813bfb2c9015343ec2d5ca.mp4?t=1765428762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapting a first <i>D&amp;D</i> adventure of an inexperienced Dungeon Master, <strong><i>Ass Kicker</i></strong> is a first game of an equally inexperienced deV! (<strong><i>AK</i></strong>: He is obviously talking about himself...)<br>Experience a story created from Friendship, tabletop madness, the dumbest of jokes...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And above all...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PURE OBESSESION FOR A DREAM. (<strong><i>AK</i></strong>: Yep... the deV is kind of nuts)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img