 Art! (AK: Experimental because the dev can’t draw properly!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/9e41f13f7e1e1e5a68c2fcc12007590c.avif?t=1765428762\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/99e5f8cf7a9cb163ee63446ff6580025.avif?t=1765428762\" width=64 height=64 /></span><i>(<strong>AK</strong>: Seriously, if you add us to your wishlist, I'll drink a Strawberry milk in your honor!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what are you waiting for?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your hat, tune your instrument, and join the song.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Legends don’t write themselves — and every good story needs a solid kick to get started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">(<strong><i>AK</i></strong>: Man... I can't believe he menaged to explain the title)</p>", "short_description": "In Ass Kicker, fight and dodge your way through enemies and explore the cursed lands of Askverg in search of the not-so-perfect party of heroes to defeat the dark lord of the hour and give these champions the kick in the butt they need to get going!", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“Muito Bom!!”<br />\r\n1000 – Minha Vó<br />\r\n", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/63b88de6ebd976d9fbee3881649b19f3ca1b92ec/header.jpg?t=1765428762", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/861fb600dd11f9801eb5475ea151a5dabf0474f4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765428762", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_